{
  "title": "Quenched Mediterranean Chickpea Fritters",
  "description": "A cultured, light Mediterranean chickpea fritter perfect for a post-workout snack, featuring a warm speculaas spice mix and crisp texture without onion or garlic.",
  "cuisine": "Mediterranean",
  "diet": [
